   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "<a id=\"scratch-data\"></a>\n### 2.2 数据准备：一维非线性带噪数据\n\n使用一维非线性目标：\n\n$$\ny=\\sin(2x)+0.5x+\\varepsilon,\n\\qquad\n\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,0.25^2)\n$$\n\n\\(x\\) 从 \\([-3,3]\\) 均匀采样，共 160 个样本，固定随机种子为 42，\n按 80%/20% 划分。核岭回归将直接在一维输入上拟合这条非线性曲线。"
  },
  {
   "id": "3000ad523ab44561a95d3174c737e547",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.623989Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.624181Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.631777Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.632878Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": "训练集样本数: 128\n测试集样本数: 32\n"
    }
   ],
   "source": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nmanual_x = rng.uniform(-3, 3, 160)\nmanual_y = (\n    np.sin(2.0 * manual_x)\n    + 0.5 * manual_x\n    + rng.normal(0, 0.25, 160)\n)\n\nindices = rng.permutation(len(manual_x))\nsplit = int(0.8 * len(manual_x))\ntrain_idx, test_idx = indices[:split], indices[split:]\n\nmanual_X_train = manual_x[train_idx].reshape(-1, 1)\nmanual_X_test = manual_x[test_idx].reshape(-1, 1)\nmanual_y_train = manual_y[train_idx]\nmanual_y_test = manual_y[test_idx]\n\nprint(f\"训练集样本数: {len(manual_y_train)}\")\nprint(f\"测试集样本数: {len(manual_y_test)}\")"
  },
  {
   "id": "cc1b8ba5a29b4cdbb2457dbe4c5a04ec",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "<a id=\"kr-scratch\"></a>\n### 2.3 模型实现：`KernelRidgeScratch`\n\n`fit` 计算 RBF 核矩阵并求解对偶系数\n\\(\\boldsymbol\\alpha=(\\boldsymbol K+\\lambda\\boldsymbol I)^{-1}\\boldsymbol y\\)；\n`predict` 计算新样本与所有训练样本的核值，再与系数加权求和。"
  },
  {
   "id": "f2e630b2e271445d9e240567f7771db0",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.634726Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.634969Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.639706Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T08:37:50.640818Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": "class KernelRidgeScratch:\n    '''使用 RBF 核与对偶解实现的教学版核岭回归。'''\n\n    def __init__(self, gamma=1.0, alpha=0.1):\n        self.gamma = gamma\n        self.alpha = alpha\n\n    def _rbf(self, X1, X2):\n        distance_sq = (\n            (X1[:, None, :] - X2[None, :, :]) ** 2\n        ).sum(axis=-1)\n        return np.exp(-self.gamma * distance_sq)\n\n    def fit(self, X, y):\n        X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float).reshape(-1, 1)\n        y = np.asarray(y, dtype=float)\n        K = self._rbf(X, X)\n        n = len(X)\n        self.alpha_coef_ = np.linalg.solve(\n            K + self.alpha * np.eye(n),\n            y,\n        )\n        self.X_train_ = X\n        return self\n\n    def predict(self, X):\n        X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float).reshape(-1, 1)\n        K_test = self._rbf(X, self.X_train_)\n        return K_test @ self.alpha_coef_"
  },
  {
   "id": "d973ab028e7f4e3cbf25e07d8d1ca1c3",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "<a id=\"scratch-evaluation\"></a>\n### 2.4 训练评估：拟合、超参数与回归指标\n\n核岭回归的两个关键旋钮是 \\(\\gamma\\)（影响半径）和 \\(\\lambda\\)（正则强度）。\n下面用固定 \\(\\lambda=0.05\\) 对比三个 \\(\\gamma\\)，再给出主模型的测试集指标。"
  },
