      "text/html": "<div style=\"max-width:780px\"><h4>手写核岭回归：测试集指标（test metrics）</h4><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px\"><thead><tr><th style=\"padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#eef3ff\">指标</th><th style=\"padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#eef3ff\">数值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">MSE</td><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">0.056</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">RMSE</td><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">0.236</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">MAE</td><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">0.195</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">R²</td><td style=\"padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid #dde3ee\">0.946</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
